key text editor
---------------

Is a simple text editor written in C using termios, this editor is based on VIM and uses some keybindings, for example 'h', 'j', 'k', 'l' and others.

Dependencies
------------
	C99
	Standard Headers
	makefile

Compile
-------

Just run 'make' in root directory.

To execute use 'make run'.

Warning
-------

